The review found 10 issues. Two are real bugs in the tool-config script, two are gaps (one in the plugin checker, one in the graph lock), and the rest are cleanup, design-depth and docs findings. They are ranked most severe first below.

The top issue is confirmed: I spliced a dprint config that had one extra exclude below the block, and the comma before it was lost. The other findings come from reading the code, without running it.

I reviewed `git diff e53f4a10...HEAD`, the range from the base commit to HEAD. Round 1's findings that the fix commits already addressed are not repeated, and I left out work owned by units still pending (U6–U8, plan 3).

